s:On primary write error stop before updating derived state
s-&gt;t : recordReview(course, event)
t:Update counts in memory and attempt progress.json save
t-&gt;h : update(subject)
h:Keep unique saved-source event in memory and attempt history.json save
t-&gt;d : update(subject)
d-&gt;f : getProgressSnapshot / getHistorySnapshot
f.&gt;d : memory copies only
s.&gt;f : review saved or primary error
f.&gt;u : completion or error (storage warnings available separately)
